<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Land in JV with Siam Cement, Redland.</title>
<headline>Ayala Land in JV with Siam Cement, Redland.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Land Inc said on Wednesday it had formed a joint venture with Redland PLC and Siam Cement Public Company Limited to manufacture high-quality rooftiles for the Philippine market.</p>
</text>
